><g class="rf-ev"><line x1="534.3" x2="534.3" y1="160" y2="166"/><circle cx="534.3" cy="160" r="8"/><text x="534.3" y="164" text-anchor="middle">6</text><title>1849: Hungarian forces surrender at Világos after Russian intervention</title></g><g class="rf-ev"><line x1="728.6" x2="728.6" y1="160" y2="166"/><circle cx="728.6" cy="160" r="8"/><text x="728.6" y="164" text-anchor="middle">7</text><title>1866: Prussia defeats Austria at the Battle of Königgrätz</title></g><g class="rf-ev"><line x1="740.0" x2="740.0" y1="160" y2="166"/><circle cx="740.0" cy="160" r="8"/><text x="740.0" y="164" text-anchor="middle">8</text><title>1867: The Compromise with Hungary creates Austria-Hungary</title></g><text class="rf-axis" x="20" y="200">1804 CE</text><text class="rf-axis" x="740" y="200" text-anchor="end">1867 CE</text></svg><figcaption>Relative power on the Institute's 0–10 scale (each profile scaled to its own peak). Numbers mark the key events below.</figcaption></figure><ol class="rf-events"><li><span class="rf-year">1804</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/francis-ii">Francis II</a> proclaims himself hereditary Emperor of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austria">Austria</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1806</span><span class="rf-text">Francis dissolves the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/holy-roman-empire">Holy Roman Empire</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1809</span><span class="rf-text">Archduke Charles defeats <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/napoleon">Napoleon</a> at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-aspern-essling">Aspern-Essling</a> before defeat at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-wagram">Wagram</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1814–1815</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/congress-of-vienna">Congress of Vienna</a> redraws <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/europe">Europe</a> under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/klemens-von-metternich">Metternich</a>'s guidance</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1848</span><span class="rf-text">Revolutions drive <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/klemens-von-metternich">Metternich</a> into exile; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/franz-joseph-i">Franz Joseph</a> succeeds Ferdinand I</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1849</span><span class="rf-text">Hungarian forces surrender at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/surrender-at-vilagos">Világos</a> after Russian intervention</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1866</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-prussia">Prussia</a> defeats <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austria">Austria</a> at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-koniggratz">Battle of Königgrätz</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1867</span><span class="rf-text">The Compromise with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hungary">Hungary</a> creates <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austro-hungarian-empire">Austria-Hungary</a></span></li></ol>
